WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.628
Hello!

00:00:01.578 --> 00:00:05.026
Welcome to the Simple Guide to Accountability.

00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:12.092
Sometimes, when a lot of people try to spend a really big amount of money all at once, things can get messy.

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:19.092
This guide explains a few times when our government made some big mistakes with the money that belongs to everybody.
